     "solution": "i = 0.084 ÷ 12 = 0.007，n = 240。\n(a) FV = 1200 × {{frac 1.007²⁴⁰ − 1|0.007}} = <strong>$743,013.37</strong>。\n(b) 存入 1200 × 240 = $288 000；利息 = 0 + 利息 + 288 000 = 743,013.37，所以利息 = <strong>$455,013.37</strong>。",
